                <head>No —.</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hawaiian Islands</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Island of——, District of——, ss:</hi></p>
                <p>I, the undersigned, inspector of election, duly appointed and commissioned, do
                    hereby certify that—— ——, aged —, a native of——, residing at——, in said
                    district, has this day taken, before me, the oath to support the Constitution of
                    the Hawaiian Kingdom, promulgated and proclaimed on the 7th day of July, 1887,
                    and the laws of said Kingdom.</p>
                <p>—— ——,</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#italic">Inspector of Election.</hi></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>—— —, 18—.</p>
                </postscript>
